=2 Walkthrough
!Arrapago Reef-map1.jpg||Arrapago Reef - Map 1
!Arrapago Reef-map2.jpg||Arrapago Reef - Map 2
* Obtain a {i:Corsair's Testimony|Corsair's Testimony|2332} from {m:Merrow Icedancers|Merrow Icedancer}, {m:Merrow Kabukidancers|Merrow Kabukidancer}, {m:Merrow Chantress}, or {m:Lamia Fatedealer}.
** Take the {p:Runic Portal} to {p:Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point} and head to (F-8) {z:Arrapago Reef} (Map 2) for easy access to two {m:Merrow Icedancers|Merrow Icedancer}.
** Remember to set the {p:Records of Eminence} quest under RoE > Objective > Tutorial > Level Cap Increase > Level Cap Increase: 75 (COR)
* You end up in the correct area to continue after the conclusion of {q:Against All Odds|Against All Odds|Against All Odds}
* Head to (H-10) {z:Arrapago Reef} (Map 1) and check the **???** for a cutscene.
** The **???** is the same **???** used in the {q:Luck of the Draw|Luck of the Draw|Luck of the Draw} quest.
* Upon trading the testimony to the **???**, you will receive another short cutscene and then be teleported to {z:Talacca Cove}.
* Trade the {i:Corsair's Testimony|Corsair's Testimony|2332} to the Rock Slab to enter a BCNM.
** Buffs wipe upon entry.
** If you have the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} Key Item, you are able to summon {p:Trust Magic} to aid you.
* The fight will end when the boss reaches 20%HP or less.

=2 Notes
* Does not need to be completed (for level limit increasing) if the player has already completed {q:New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await} or better.

